 to unveil crowd-pleasing budget as political pressure rises","url":"https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/economics/article/3369573/malaysias-anwar-set-unveil-crowd-pleasing-budget-political-pressure-rises?utm_source=rss_feed","source":"SCMP (홍콩)","summary":"Malaysia’s Anwar Ibrahim is expected to roll out a populist budget on Friday aimed at placating voter concerns over the cost of living and access to essential services, experts say, as the prime minister seeks to shore up support ahead of a general election that could be called as soon as next year. Anwar’s coalition government is under mounting pressure amid a deepening feud with Umno. The Malay ","published":"2026-10-05T09:00:17+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":0,"related":[],"title_ko":"말레이시아의 안와르 (Anwar) 는 정치적 압력이 높아짐에 따라 군중을 기쁘게 하는 예산을 공개할 예정이다.","summary_ko":"전문가들은 말레이시아의 안와르 이브라힘 (Anwar Ibrahim) 총리가 내년 총선을 앞두고 지지율을 높이기 위해 생활비와 필수 서비스에 대한 유권자의 우려를 해소하기 위한 포퓰리즘 예산을 금요일에 발표할 것으로 예상하고 있다. 안와르의 연합 정부는 움노와의 불화가 심화되는 가운데 압박을 받고 있습니다. 말레이인"},{"title":"Iran war live: Yemen fighting intensifies; Tehran says ready for US attacks","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/10/5/iran-war-live-fighting-in-yemen-intensifies-tehran-says-ready-for-us-war?traffic_source=rss","source":"Al Jazeera","summary":"Yemeni government announces major offensive against Houthis as Iran says it is ready to defend itself if the US attacks.","published":"2026-10-05T09:00:00+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":1,"related":[{"title":"Fighting Intensifies in Yemen, Raising Fresh Fears of All-Out War","url":"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/02/world/middleeast/yemen-houthis-saudi-arabia-sanaa-taiz.html","source":"New York Times","published":"2026-10-03T03:06:54+09:00"}],"title_ko":"이란 전쟁 생중계: 예멘전쟁 본격화, 테헤란은 미국 공격 준비 완료","summary_ko":"이란은 미국이 공격할 경우 스스로를 방어할 준비가 돼 있다고 말하면서 예멘 정부는 후티에 대한 대대적인 공격을 예고하고 있다."},{"title":"Extreme heat putting pregnant women, newborns at risk: UN climate chief","url":"https://www.channelnewsasia.com/sustainabilit